{"etape": 12, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-27T14:52:58.843825Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "I'm sorry about the frustrating experience with the delay on flight HAT018 (SEA → LAS) on May 11. I've confirmed the delay on our end.\n\nRegarding compensation for a delayed flight, I can offer a certificate as a gesture of goodwill, but this is available when the reservation is also being changed or cancelled. Would you like to change or cancel this reservation?"}, "resultat": "I don't want to change or cancel the reservation. The flight already happened, and the delay was a significant inconvenience. I'm looking for compensation specifically because of the delay itself, not because I want to alter the reservation now.", "erreur": null}
{"etape": 13, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-27T14:53:08.941164Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "I understand, and I'm sorry for the inconvenience the delay caused. Unfortunately, I'm not able to offer compensation for a delay on its own — under our policy, a delay-related certificate can only be issued in connection with a change or cancellation of the reservation.\n\nAdditionally, since the outbound portion of this trip (May 11) has already been flown, I'm not able to modify or cancel this reservation either.\n\nWould you like me to transfer you to a human agent who can review your compensation request directly?"}, "resultat": "###TRANSFER###", "erreur": null}
